# Product

## Problem and users

Describe who is worse off today and why.

## Value

Describe the outcome the project should create without prescribing its implementation.

## Goals

- Define measurable or observable goals with the user.

## Non-goals

- State what the project deliberately will not solve.

## Scope

Separate current scope from possible future scope.

## Open questions

- Record unresolved product choices and who can answer them.

